  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5095f5bb01075e14285e8eb5c1d65cde, type: 3}
  m_Name: LTC_Stone_EN
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  WelcomeText: "Welcome to Cloudveil Realm.\LLike Earth, it has plants, minerals,
    and hidden forms of life\u2014but their nature differs from what we know. In
    Cloudveil, the boundary between living and non-living is blurred. Most entities
    appear as geometric forms, where shape is not just appearance, but a transferable
    state between matter and consciousness."
  DescriptionText: "What you are holding is Fossilite\na common mineral in the Cloudveil
    Realm.\LWhen still, it looks like an ordinary rock. When squeezed or gently shaken,
    it emits metallic, instrument-like sounds.\nExcessive striking or flipping causes
    the sound to become sharp, and the Fossilite may begin to drift, leaving only
    a lingering sense of touch\u2014an indication of the boundary between life and
    non-life merging.\LTo stop this, return it to its original orientation."
  EndingText: "You are about to leave Cloudveil Realm.\LPlease take a moment to reflect
    on the sensations, sounds, and responses you experienced during the interaction.\LWe
    will ask you a few questions next, and you are very welcome to share any feelings
    or impressions you found especially meaningful."
